{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1447302-what-is-dark-glamour","id":1447302,"title":"What is Dark Glamour?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-03T17:02:56-07:00","id":1447302,"title":"What is Dark Glamour?","content":"What is Dark Glamour? And how can it be harvested?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/412-valismedsen","name":"valismedsen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar412_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T18:21:48-07:00","id":1447315,"title":"","content":"There...isn't any official write-up explaining on what Dark Glamour.<br /> <br /> We can make some inferences on the name, naturally, but no official word. And I'm not sure if any official write-up is ever coming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T19:33:10-07:00","id":1447319,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s glamour taken from nightmares/ or negative emotions with no positive effect. Sometimes Sadness, angry, fear, and other \u201cicky\u201d feeling can be useful. But dark glamour isn\u2019t like that it\u2019s the worse thoghts","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T21:11:15-07:00","id":1447333,"title":"","content":"Dark Glamour is something made up by the Unseelie to justify why its Ok to ravage people since glamour is infinite you just can't see it like Dark Matter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-04T15:55:26-07:00","id":1447470,"title":"","content":"It was originally going to be detailed in Book of Glamour. Obviously, that didn\u2019t happen. A group of us are revisiting it for Harbingers of Winter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-05T09:36:08-07:00","id":1447587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1447302-what-is-dark-glamour?p=1447319#post1447319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It\u2019s glamour taken from nightmares/ or negative emotions with no positive effect. Sometimes Sadness, angry, fear, and other \u201cicky\u201d feeling can be useful. But dark glamour isn\u2019t like that it\u2019s the worse thoghts</div> </div> </div> </div>So basically, it\u2019s akin to the Dementors from Harry Potter?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-05T09:54:50-07:00","id":1447593,"title":"","content":"Kind of I suppose.<br /> <br /> The line between Dream Glamour &amp; Dark Glamour is thin (looking at you Redcaps) but basically my rule of thumb is that if it appeals to primeval humanity\u2019s animal instincts as viewed through the lenses of the Elder Dark/Fomorians (terror, sorrow, pain, fear, etc) than it\u2019s Dark Glamour but if it appeals to higher and more enlightened human emotions as viewed through the lenses of the Firstborn/Tuatha (nobility, daydream, love, home, etc) it\u2019s Dream Glamour.<br /> <br /> I\u2019ve never been sure how to handle these things mechanically although part of me has considered the idea of having Dark Glamour, if enough is absorbed, cause the unseelie legacy to become a thallain legacy and vice versa if the Thallain absorbs enough Dream Glamour. But that\u2019s a very rough draft one thought.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-05T14:18:34-07:00","id":1447626,"title":"","content":"Sometimes sorrow and pain can be used for good","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-05T14:31:06-07:00","id":1447632,"title":"","content":"Aye, that\u2019s why the Redcaps and Slaugh are kithain. They have a positive end-goal that their dream is built around, but the frightening thing about the thallain is that they really don\u2019t. They like pain and fear and sorrow for the fun of it and they\u2019d rather humanity have nothing else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-05T14:47:00-07:00","id":1447635,"title":"","content":"Thanks, people!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/412-valismedsen","name":"valismedsen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar412_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-05T17:27:37-07:00","id":1447668,"title":"","content":"I seriously hope &quot;Dark Glamour&quot; is more than just &quot;glamour from mean situations&quot; because changelings are meant to be more Orange and Blue than that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-13T13:55:45-07:00","id":1448460,"title":"","content":"In my table we decided that dark glamour is glamour from really fucked up things. Im not talking unseelie ruining a work of art or ravaging, more about tzimisce art, like cathedral of flesh levels of fucked up. And harvesting it also makes you get nightmare dice, the dice go away once you spend all the dark glamour thought.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26021-rucun","name":"Rucun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-23T12:03:20-07:00","id":1449365,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1447302-what-is-dark-glamour?p=1447668#post1447668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I seriously hope &amp;quot;Dark Glamour&amp;quot; is more than just &amp;quot;glamour from mean situations&amp;quot; because changelings are meant to be more Orange and Blue than that.</div> </div> </div> </div>It\u2019s definitely more than simply being unseelie. Seelie and Unseelie are both products of the Tuathan Dream. It takes more than that to fall under the purview of the Dark.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-23T14:01:27-07:00","id":1449374,"title":"","content":"As part of my Demon the Fallen and Changeling crossover game, I came up with an analogy between Glamour and Faith (harvested by believing in some higher force, either hopeful or despairing, creative or destructive, angelic or infernal) and Dark Glamour and Torment, which is raw emotional trauma, without belief in anything transcendental.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/412-valismedsen","name":"valismedsen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar412_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}